      "guid": null,
      "name": "EPAKIM1 Trader Mod",
      "slug": "epakim1-trader-mod",
      "teaser": "Trader mod that adds in the popular and up-and-coming artist \"Epakim1\" and his characters and art work into the world of Tarkov. With custom quests included!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2806.png",
      "downloads": 11414,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p>This mod requires <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/885-virtual-s-custom-quest-loader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Virtuals Custom Quest Loader</a> in order to operate!!!</p>\n<p>Introducing my first attempt at a mod, in homage to an artist that of whom’ artwork I extremely enjoy.</p>\n<p>This trader mod includes just under 10 fully custom quests made possible by Virtual and his excellent and “easy” to grasp mod; VCQL.</p>\n<p>As well as a fully custom and arranged menu of barters and tradeable items. This trader features levels 1 - 4 trades in correspondence with the players “affinity” towards the trader themself!</p>\n<p>All artwork used for every single quest/thumbnail is artwork created by Epakim1. Check out their amazing and kickass artwork and socials at the following: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/EPAKIM1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EPAKIM1</a></p>\n<p>Disclaimer: { EPAKIM himself has given me permission to utilize his awesome artwork for this mod, in both discord VC and DMs. }</p>\n<p>If you have any criticisms or any sort of feedback, please leave a comment and let me know what can be improved. I will try to maintain this mod in accordance to the updates of SPT in between my work hours and such.</p>\n<p>Have fun and get to work errand boys.</p>\n<p>Ensure you copy and paste every folder file within the link folder.</p>\n<p>Ensure you install VCQL FIRST then Epakim1 and select the replace folders option.</p>\n<p>{Update: Fixed multiple items in Epakim’s inventory that were unable to be purchased.} 5/2/25</p>\n<p>{Update: Added altyn faceshield as a barter in a later trader lvl tier.} 5/15/25</p>\n<p>{08/04/2025 - Fixed trader affinity scoring per mission rewards to allow for mastery of the trader.}</p>\n<p>{Update: New Quest &amp; Russian translation added. 8/22/2025</p>\n<p>(Special Thanks)</p>\n<p>- EpaKim1 - For his awesome artwork</p>\n<p>- Morchello - For RU translation</p>\n<p>- <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/37013-bushtail/?highlight=bushtail\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bushtail</a> - Teaching me the fundamentals &amp; helping endlessly</p>\n",
